  "evidence": "TEXT_E: \"modernise the NHS to deliver faster treatment, free at the point of use\"; \"power, wealth and opportunity in the hands of the many, not the few\"; \"minimum wage rising to £4.20\"; stronger support for children and families via tax and benefits; better cash and services for pensioners; 20,000 extra nurses, 10,000 extra doctors, 10,000 extra teachers; tackle causes of crime and empower local communities. TEXT_C: leave the EU, restore full sovereignty and a new UK Bill of Rights; a “bonfire” of regulation and tax simplification; selection/streaming in schools and discipline; deterrent sentencing and locally accountable policing; skills‑based immigration; raise the income‑tax threshold to lift low earners out of tax; increase state pension and elderly care; NHS decentralisation and nurse pay rises.",
